## Learning Activities and Resources

This week, I created a WordPress website for my startup project using a free online hosting service. I learned how to install WordPress, select and activate themes, create pages, configure the homepage, and build a navigation menu. Since I had already developed a similar website using Joomla, I was able to reuse the content and focus on understanding the WordPress platform and its features.

